{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "粉红色笔记本  (Xingzi's Pink Fan-Club Notebook)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Curious about the well-organised fans she saw at the Star Night red carpet, Bu Xiaogu asks Xingzi who led them and gets lent Xingzi's prized pink notebook of fan-club contacts. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，那天有一个男的拉了好几车专业的粉丝，他是谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你说的是粉红哥吧？他叫许天泽。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他是辛惠美粉丝后援会的会长。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他是典型富二代，在粉丝圈里边很有影响力。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对，那天粉丝们都特别听他的指挥。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "现在的粉丝文化已经很发达了，粉丝的意见我们要尊重。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "和粉丝后援会搞好关系，对于我们做节目至关重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这里面是所有明星粉丝团的资料，借你看一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "小粉红笔记本？杏子姐这是你私藏的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "重点不要放在我的粉红色笔记本上！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "快看资料查邮件，事情很多，不要出错。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，那天有一个男的拉了好几车专业的粉丝，他是谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, a man brought several busloads of organised fans that day; who is he?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你说的是粉红哥吧？他叫许天泽。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You mean Brother Fenhong, right? His name is Xu Tianze.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他是辛惠美粉丝后援会的会长。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is the president of Xin Huimei's official fan club.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他是典型富二代，在粉丝圈里边很有影响力。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is a classic wealthy heir and carries strong influence in fan circles.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对，那天粉丝们都特别听他的指挥。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, the fans all followed his lead closely that day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "现在的粉丝文化已经很发达了，粉丝的意见我们要尊重。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fan culture today is very developed, and we need to respect fan opinions.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "和粉丝后援会搞好关系，对于我们做节目至关重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maintaining good relations with fan clubs is vital for producing our shows.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这里面是所有明星粉丝团的资料，借你看一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Inside here is information on every celebrity fan club; borrow it and take a look.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "小粉红笔记本？杏子姐这是你私藏的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A little pink notebook? Xingzi, is this from your personal stash?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "重点不要放在我的粉红色笔记本上！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not focus on the colour of my pink notebook!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "快看资料查邮件，事情很多，不要出错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry up and check the files and emails; there is plenty to do, so make no mistakes.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，那天有一个男的拉了好几车专业的粉丝，他是谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
